🎨 Canvas

SageMaker Canvas is a low-code/no-code machine learning tool.

You can build some ML models with less coding:

Upload Data 📊
      ↓
SageMaker Canvas
      ↓
Build ML Model 🧠
      ↓
Prediction 🔮

==

For example:

Sales prediction
Customer churn prediction
Demand forecasting

