Simple difference

| Application          | Main use                                 |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| **SageMaker Studio** | Complete AI/ML development environment   |
| **JupyterLab**       | Write and run Python/code notebooks      |
| **Canvas**           | Build ML models with little or no coding |


===========
AI/ML learning, SageMaker Studio and JupyterLab are the most relevant options.
